    "bbox": [
      180.81,
      432.89,
      409.53,
      456.23
    ],
    "text": "to amend the Petroleum Products (Special Provisions)Act, No. 33 of 2002",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      238.39,
      271.03,
      360.67,
      280.1
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      290.23,
      455.51,
      318.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends the long title to the Petroleum Products (Special Provisions)Act, No. 33 of 2002 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 4.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.47,
      328.63,
      423.23,
      337.7
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause is consequential to the amendment made by clause 4.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      347.83,
      455.53,
      376.1
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause replaces section 3 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as replaced is to make provision for the Committee appointed by the Cabinetof Ministers, to be vested with the powers under the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      386.23,
      455.5,
      414.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause amends section 6 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof this section as amended is to substitute the words \u201cthe Minister\u201d for the words \u201cMinisterin charge of the subject of Power and Energy\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      424.63,
      455.53,
      462.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6 : This clause amends section 9 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof this section as amended is to insert the new definition of the expression \u201cMinister\u201d andto remove the definition of the expression \u201cEnergy Supply Committee\u201d consequential tothe amendment made by clause 4.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      472.63,
      455.48,
      491.3
    ],
    "text": "Clause 7 : This clause provides validity for the powers exercised and acts done prior tothe commencement of the amending Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      501.43,
      455.51,
      529.7
    ],
    "text": "Clause 8 : This clause provides for transitional provisions and the legal effect of thesection is to extend the applicability of the provisions of the amending Act, to licencesalready issued under the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      198.21,
      166.97,
      401.69,
      191.39
