      166.97,
      360.81,
      191.39
    ],
    "text": "2Petroleum Products (Special Provisions)(Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      202.97,
      397.19,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "3. (1) There shall be a Committee appointedby the Cabinet of Ministers (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cCommittee\u201d), subject to thesucceeding provisions of this section toexercise, perform and discharge the powers,duties and functions hereinafter set out.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      286.97,
      397.18,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Committee shall consist of thefollowing:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      234.19,
      322.97,
      337.71,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)ex-officio members\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      265.15,
      346.97,
      397.17,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)the Secretary to the Ministryof the Minister assigned thesubject of Petroleum, whoshall be the Chairman of theCommittee;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      262.15,
      418.97,
      397.18,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "(ii)the Secretary to the Treasuryor his nominee not below therank of Director-General ofthe Treasury;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      234.19,
      478.97,
      397.17,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)the Chairman or Managing-Directorof the Ceylon PetroleumCorporation, established underCeylon Petroleum Corporation Act,No. 28 of 1961, nominated by theMinister;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      234.19,
      562.97,
      397.17,
      610.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)two members appointed fromamong persons who have achievedeminence in the field of petroleumindustry or law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      622.97,
      397.18,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(3) A member of the Committee appointedunder paragraph (c) of subsection (2), shall holdoffice for the period of two years from the dateof appointment unless such member resigns",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
